  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-13T03:59:01.587Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "More simplified Text Chatbox for Desktop Users. Pressing keybind T or Enter, to open chat input line without the need of an entire on screen keyboard. It's really hard to notice if a message was sent, considering nothing is notifying you. So you would have to look up and see if it was sent. I think desktop users needs these features:\n - Keybind to open chat input line for quick and easy access like most games.\n - Chatbox on screen, so you can see messages from anywhere, not just over their heads. (It's very awkward using small  avatars, or just having to look up and see a message.)\n - Optional on screen ChatBox that fades away after typed/received message.\n - Optional Bubble Indicator beside mic icon.",
